WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.697 --> 00:00:06.295
- There's nothing more annoying than

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:09.199
a baby crying on a plane.

00:00:09.199 --> 00:00:12.077
- Car honking is just so obnoxious.

00:00:12.077 --> 00:00:16.279
- Most annoying noise in the
world is my mother's voice.

00:00:16.279 --> 00:00:17.324
(imitates car honking sound)

00:00:17.324 --> 00:00:20.157
- Any sound that wakes me
up is an unpleasant sound.

00:00:20.157 --> 00:00:22.433
- The squeaky noise when you
have friction on balloons.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:23.942
- The original Nokia ringtone.

00:00:23.942 --> 00:00:26.519
- When someone is handling styrofoam.

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:28.028
(imitates squeaking styrofoam)

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.353
(imitates squeaking surfaces)

00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:30.931
(imitates ringtone)

00:00:30.931 --> 00:00:34.274
- As a kid, I used to be scared
of the THX sound in movies.

00:00:34.274 --> 00:00:36.350
(imitates deep bass sound)

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.989
And you're just like, why is no one

00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:39.661
else freaking out right now?

00:00:49.851 --> 00:00:51.103
- What would be number one?

00:00:51.103 --> 00:00:53.402
I wanna say babies crying because I feel

00:00:53.402 --> 00:00:54.818
like that's pretty universal.

00:00:54.818 --> 00:00:56.792
- I think it's just going
to sound like a really bad

00:00:56.792 --> 00:00:59.979
Nine Inch Nails song, like
an unreleased deep track.

00:01:04.319 --> 00:01:06.004
(electric drill sound)

00:01:06.004 --> 00:01:07.792
(baby crying sound)

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:09.603
(bike brakes sound)

00:01:09.603 --> 00:01:11.044
(grinder sound)

00:01:11.044 --> 00:01:12.923
(female screaming)

00:01:12.923 --> 00:01:14.550
(sound of nails on blackboard)

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.104
(sound of ruler on bottle)

00:01:16.104 --> 00:01:17.799
(sound of chalk on blackboard)

00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:19.356
(sound of fork on glass)

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:24.165
(suspenseful music)

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:38.291
(sound of disgust)

00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:40.241
(sound of knife on bottle)

00:01:41.641 --> 00:01:43.301
- It's definitely one of the worst,

00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:45.669
but it also kinda sounds
like a rusty swing set.

00:01:45.669 --> 00:01:46.923
- That just sucked.

00:01:46.923 --> 00:01:47.991
That just really, really sucked.

00:01:47.991 --> 00:01:52.147
- Fine tuned to worm
its way into your brain.

00:01:52.147 --> 00:01:54.144
- I could take that, but like baby crying

00:01:54.144 --> 00:01:56.165
for an hour I couldn't take.

00:01:56.165 --> 00:01:58.323
- I still think the THX noise is scarier.

00:01:58.323 --> 00:02:00.111
- Styrofoam is worse for me.

00:02:00.111 --> 00:02:03.177
- To the person who decided
to record this noise,

00:02:03.177 --> 00:02:04.110
(bleep) you.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.677
- [Voiceover] My mom's voice is like

00:02:09.677 --> 00:02:12.783
a cat that won't stop scratching.

00:02:12.784 --> 00:02:14.337
(imitates scratching sound)

00:02:14.337 --> 00:02:15.157
When are you going to get married?

00:02:15.157 --> 00:02:16.875
(imitates scratching sound)

00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:17.898
I want grandchildren.

00:02:17.898 --> 00:02:20.806
Why do you spend so much
money on Cheesecake Factory?

